file). Tests ship at `apps/apple/Tests/Unit/Features/Admin/**` (where every sibling page's model
tests live). This is the same reconciliation the DiskForecast / SlowQueries logs recorded; it is
the only deviation from the literal prompt path.

ROUTE HOSTING: the web route `/admin/vehicle-cost` is registered as a dedicated native route
`.vehicleCost` (mirroring the sibling `.slowQueries`), reachable via the System-group sidebar entry
and these deep-link aliases added to `AppRouteParser` — `/admin/vehicle-cost` and
`/admin/observability/vehicle-cost` (plus the canonical `/vehicle-cost`). `VehicleCostRouteRegistration`
hosts `VehicleCostPage` on `.vehicleCost`, chained through the shared `routeHostRegistry` in
`TeslaSyncApp.swift`. Recorded here per covenant #9.

